    - Safety stock and reorder point calculations.
    - 60-day inventory simulations.
    - Purchase-order planning.
    - Demand spike and supplier delay scenarios.
    - Amazon FBA inventory allocation.
    - Fulfillment cost analysis.
    - Working capital and financial impact estimates.

    ### Important Limitations

    - All datasets are synthetic.
    - No actual Pocket operational information is used.
    - The 12-week forecast has not been validated
      at a 12-week forecasting horizon.
    - The 3.89% WAPE applies to a one-week-ahead
      historical simulation.
    - Supplier lead times and costs are assumed.
    - Proposed orders require feasibility validation.
    - Warehouse data is illustrative.
    - Financial outcomes are not actual company results.

    ### Project Purpose

    This independent portfolio project demonstrates
    supply chain analysis, forecasting, inventory
